flowchart TB
  A[同一张原始图像] --> G[2 个 Global Crops]
  A --> L[多个 Local Crops]

  subgraph ENC[Student / Teacher 编码]
    G --> T[EMA Teacher ViT]
    G --> S[Student ViT]
    L --> S
    M[随机 Mask Patch] --> S
    S -. EMA 参数更新 .-> T
  end

  subgraph CLS[DINO 图像级分支]
    T --> TC[Teacher CLS + DINO Head]
    S --> SC[Student CLS + DINO Head]
    TC --> LD[DINO Cross Entropy]
    SC --> LD
  end

  subgraph PATCH[iBOT Patch 级分支]
    T --> TP[Teacher Patch + iBOT Head]
    S --> SP[Masked Patch + iBOT Head]
    TP --> LI[iBOT Patch Cross Entropy]
    SP --> LI
  end

  S --> K[KoLeo：拉开 Batch 内最近邻特征]
